-- title:
--   Pauli-X followed by first-Hide retains exactly the selected coarse label
-- statement:
--   A statement of the module `MIPRE.Foundations.Introspection.HonestFirstHide` of the MIP\* = RE formalization (commit `70cbf1c` of vidick/MIPRE-formalization). The honest first hiding measurement. At the first hiding type no Z-prefix has yet been measured. The honest measurement is exactly a coarse-graining of the full Pauli-X measurement: read the dual map on the first CL register and retain the untouched X tail. This constructs the measurement and proves perfect acceptance and commutation on the Pauli-X/first-Hide edge, on the entire answer alphabet.
--
--   Pauli-X followed by first-Hide retains exactly the selected coarse label.
